      "writtenOn": "2026-07-29T08:03:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@michael@amarulasolutions.com Please disregard my previous reply: `Status.NOT_APPLICABLE` means simply that the condition does not match. \n\nOnly two statuses are expected here:\nSATISFIED: the applicability condition matches → start the review.\nNOT_APPLICABLE: the condition does not match → skip normally.\n\nEvery other status means Gerrit could not produce the expected applicability result. For example:\nERROR: invalid expression or evaluation error.\nTIMEOUT: evaluation timed out.\nUNSATISFIED: unexpected here because the submittability expression is hardcoded to is:true.\n\nAll these cases should result in an error.",
      "parentUuid": "02b1ad2b_2a3c18f4",
